    "tagLine": "12 Months Free WiFi for New Residents",
    "location": "Quayside Quarter is conveniently located in Dublin Docklands, only 5 minutes from the Docklands rapid rail station (DART) and directly next to the Spencer Dock light rail station (LUAS).\nFrom Quayside Quarter, Point Square can be reached in approximately 1 minute on foot, while offices in the IFSC are approximately 4 minutes away on foot. Dublin Airport is approximately 20 minutes away by taxi.\n\nDublin Docklands Neighbourhood\nThe neighbourhood draws its inspiration from the fabric of Dublin and the rich industrial heritage of the Docklands, infused with contemporary Scandinavian architectural accents and Brooklyn loft-style design. Curated wild landscapes sit alongside bustling streets with restaurants, cafés and stores. A riverfront boutique hotel anchors the area, contributing to a vibrant new neighbourhood.\n\nContact Quayside Quarter\nTo contact a member of the Quayside Quarter site team, email team@qquarter.com or call 01 5395960.\n"
